description=More ammunition for Guns of Marz, all real loads of 1993: subsonic, hollow point, soft point, steel core, +P and +P+ rounds, birdshot and the AS VAL's SP-6. Adjusted gun sounds, full metal jacket rifle rounds pierce, the break-action shotguns' stocks can be sawn off to fit a holster, an AWC Mk9 suppressor for the MP5 and the Uzis, the Uzi, Mini Uzi and Micro Uzi, and the M249 light machine gun; belt-fed guns (the M249 and the M60) now need belt links, found or made. Every new round can be made with Ammo Maker. Needs Gunworks-gang, Guns of Marz and Ammo Maker.
